# cw-tune-tema-sunlit: the CW tune widget under the shipped "Sunlit" theme
# (rootfs/usr/share/x6200/themes/Sunlit.json), the only light theme of the six:
# the bars used to fall at 1.01:1 against the widget's own panel and disappear
# (docs/HALLAZGOS.md 49). Same route and same state as cw-tune-tuner — the CW page
# of the button bar, the Tuner button pressed, a synthetic 8 Hz tone so the active
# block is drawn — and the theme is the only variable, so the render is the
# daylight identity of the widget. This is the fixture that measures the fix: the
# inactive bars carry the high-contrast border and the active block keeps its own.

name cw-tune-tema-sunlit
screen cw-tune-tuner

theme Sunlit
seed 20

frequency_hz 7030000
tx_frequency_hz 7030000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode cw
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
